{"title":"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">2008 AMC 12A #10</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2008 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">2008 AMC 10A #13</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Doug can paint a room in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours. Dave can paint the same room in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours. Doug and Dave paint the room together and take a one-hour break for lunch. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be the total time, in hours, required for them to complete the job working together, including lunch. Which of the following equations is satisfied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/2/8d25216540337623fc3951cb378f845778d5df09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\left(\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{7}\\right)\\left(t+1\\right)=1\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\left(\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{7}\\right)t+1=1\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\left(\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{7}\\right)t=1\\\\\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\left(\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{7}\\right)\\left(t-1\\right)=1\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\left(5+7\\right)t=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"602\" height=\"87\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Doug can paint <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d129a7b3c0bf9fbd0693afdd426a66d2a0a8c3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of a room per hour, Dave can paint <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/f/23ff72be03eaa06690b47e6349cade434c034e6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of a room per hour, and the time they spend working together is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/c/a3cb536b3f4c305aaa93321db33f59de320bf8eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"40\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since rate multiplied by time gives output, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d56c8addf74d606870dc7e9bff1ae899ed6eed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{7}\\right)\\left(t-1\\right)=1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"217\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>If one person does a job in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> hours and another person does a job in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> hours, the time it takes to do the job together is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba12dc0fbbf04f35c0284b13e88fe6ccc7840490.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{ab}{a+b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"42\" height=\"39\" /> hours.\n</p><p>Since Doug paints a room in 5 hours and Dave paints a room in 7 hours, they both paint in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd600061c81cd46db49037f9c0642279781e0e64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5\\times7}{5+7} = \\frac{35}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"89\" height=\"39\" /> hours. They also take 1 hour for lunch, so the total time <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/2325162a191e20779ce8099018b5c6d5467b1864.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = \\frac{35}{12} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" /> hours.\n</p><p>Looking at the answer choices, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4066cd24c53cd4053f840d210f974f46e1d913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(D)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" /> is the only one satisfied by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/2/2325162a191e20779ce8099018b5c6d5467b1864.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = \\frac{35}{12} + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A\">2008 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selfli